haracter\":\"Mr. Yu\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/v3lfw5aHOy0paOCx6WHiSnwzbH0.jpg\"},{\"id\":548616,\"name\":\"Wilson Lam Chun-yin\",\"character\":\"Helmsman\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iSZ7ggcTeJJDySVWEu8Or3VqQM4.jpg\"},{\"id\":32494,\"name\":\"Robert Easton\",\"character\":\"American Tourist\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/17cLA9SHPbACHPrTfh5yfzS1ZJM.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":374671,\"title\":\"After the Storm\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uwpBfqI1xPkSWD5PYlwypoBIkpz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6v9G4Sc5ciRUoJ2wkutX3JBQj9K.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ryota is an unpopular writer although he won a literary award 15 years ago. Now, Ryota works as a private detective. He is divorced from his ex-wife Kyoko and he has an 11-year-old son Shingo. His mother Yoshiko lives alone at her apartment. One day, Ryota, his ex-wife Kyoko, and son Shingo gather at Yoshiko's apartment. A typhoon passes and the family must stay there all night long.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2841,\"title\":\"A Very Long Engagement\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jZ3Ir3d69dsyxif8dTVh3DjKzKH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vOpm4wQk5qIl8UepoKrpaloqaPC.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Young Frenchwoman Mathilde searches for the truth about her missing fiancé, lost during World War I, and learns many unexpected things along the way. The love of her life is gone. But she refuses to believe he's gone forever — and she needs to know for sure.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":504562,\"title\":\"Motherless Brooklyn\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2wm20cbkH1L8nA54Gtwfgz2hTqo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xMHeU84wLQ9uH9acJ0oPgdii9wO.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"New York City, 1957. Lionel Essrog, a private detective living with Tourette syndrome, tries to solve the murder of his mentor and best friend, armed only with vague clues and the strength of his obsessive mind.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":890980,\"title\":\"God's Crooked Lines\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n3X9tWYFYfE96BoNgtVffuwzQo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dtXcuwF1uUi9m0VVfEGEa7GpDzX.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Alice Gould, a private investigator, pretends to be mentally ill in order to enter a psychiatric hospital and gather evidence for the case she is working on: the death of a patient in unclear circumstances.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":98357,\"title\":\"Broken City\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hqa5FwNZC55zqSpdeGFtBDqw55y.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lZ9OGovrjamAVz3n6TjJts2npxE.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a broken city rife with injustice, ex-cop Billy Taggart seeks redemption and revenge after being double-crossed and then framed by its most powerful figure, the mayor. Billy's relentless pursuit of justice, matched only by his streetwise toughness, makes him an unstoppable force - and the mayor's worst nightmare.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":244509,\"title\":\"Cold in July\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gzHS4ehNU6wapLt9UpA1rNnljiO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/erszaeysMaU83F5XKBa1oUGHF5R.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"While investigating noises in his house one balmy Texas night in 1989, Richard Dane puts a bullet in the brain of a low-life burglar. Although he’s hailed as a small-town hero, Dane soon finds himself fearing for his family’s safety when Freddy’s ex-con father rolls into town, hell-bent on revenge.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":404604,\"title\":\"Mom\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3aZhDbPRMPUZd2mCCeETnxZq1On.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cCV4rIBtBjSDmAbP1SFaRz7CZV4.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After her stepdaughter is sexually assaulted at a party, a furious mother sets out to destroy the lives of the four perpetrators who walked free.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":177494,\"title\":\"Veronica Mars\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qWBAPJdew9MRUv8ApRPkXAM1feB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n87QS93x8YiTjeOf94WRQWhXFPn.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Years after walking away from her past as a teenage private eye, Veronica Mars gets pulled back to her hometown - just in time for her high school reunion - in order to help her old flame Logan Echolls, who's embroiled in a murder mystery.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":859235,\"title\":\"Coup de chance\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cvejKWAstLqgUmC4N8P81CyhJdI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xSIJy4vPKpo2uw6q7HNBhIvQaj6.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Fanny and Jean have everything of an ideal couple: fulfilled professionally, they live in a magnificent apartment in the beautiful districts of Paris, and seem to be in love as on the first day. But when Fanny crosses, by chance, former classmate Alain, she's immediately capsized. They see each other again very quickly and grow closer.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2722,\"title\":\"The Other Side of the Bed\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6qHQ1dnXeJnV9fg7UINvGrZfBKx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gw108P9cMhSgCw2Efsp7eNWis2U.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Paula leaves her mate Pedro, he misses her and looks for comfort with his best friends, Javier and Sonia. Paula is having an affair with Javier. Pedro tries to find who is the secret lover of Paula, and hires a private eye. Meanwhile, while comforting Pedro, Sonia has a one night stand with him and Javier thinks she is cheating on him with her lesbian friend Luzia.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":18711,\"title\":\"Silver City\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9WNpjGCUTCC21fIcUpZ9lX0PJyU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5MDzSwqW4rgIp75GWCGjEYCYwam.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The discovery of a corpse and the ensuing probe by an idealistic journalist threatens to unravel a bumbling local politician's campaign for governor of Colorado.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":35219,\"title\":\"The Missing Person\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fwjX5pXrylMXtPCmYq7MzoTVJ5H.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qRXBl8UONBwhjj2T8qQk5h80ZXW.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"John Rosow drinks to forget.  He is a former New York City cop turned Chicago-based private investigator. At the last minute, he is hired by someone he's never met to follow a middle-aged male subject on the soon-departing California Zephyr train to Los Angeles.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"5DOX1Poxro4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"60Ss3hlrQdg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"GUQi5IuQ1S4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"reval